# ManagerSkylark topology: the composed web server and its sites, as the
# repository's own AGENTS.md and README describe them. A demo seed for the
# Atlas project registry (see docs/atlas-projects.md); edit it in the Atlas
# editor, or change this file and import into an empty map version.
#
# Containment: 2 spaces per level. Arrows: "->" progress, "=>" dependency,
# "~>" communication (broker or protocol between sites).

ManagerSkylark | block | active | the composed web server process
  Platform | block | settled | shared libraries
    WebFramework | place | settled | themes, PageBuilder, navigation
    WebAuth | place | settled | password hashing, sessions, login views
    WebStorage | place | settled | JSON record stores with revisions
    WebAccounts | place | settled | per-site accounts and CSRF tokens
    WebEngine | place | settled | fenced sites in one process
    WebBroker | place | active | transport-independent site-to-site calls
    WebDocs | place | settled | documentation resolver for the /docs portal
  Sites | block | active | the composed websites
    Atlas | place | hot | topology map of the project
    Company | place | active | proposals, work items, ledger, contracts
    TaskFoundry | place | active | candidate tasks with evidence and submission
    Science | place | active | paper corpus and article sidecars
    PrivateHub | place | active | local repository issues and comments
    MetaAccount | place | active | ecosystem sign-in and consent grants
    Channels | place | settled | read-only AgentIPC channels
    Financials | place | active | read-only ledger summary
    YouTubePlanner | place | planned | planning overview stub
    WebChat | place | active | streaming chat to SweAgent
  Tooling | block | active | command line and tests
    SiteCli | place | settled | skylarkctl: manifest-driven CLI and REPL
    SelfTests | place | active | ManagerSkylark --test sections
    GitHubForge | place | active | GitHub backend and webapp

TaskFoundry ~> Company: submission through WebBroker
Financials ~> Company: scope-checked broker reads
TaskFoundry => Science: evidence references
TaskFoundry => PrivateHub: evidence references
